@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@admin = http://127.0.0.1:9191
@adminToken = dev-security-token
@route = demo-app

### 1. Purge the Route cache so the demonstration starts deterministically
POST {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/cache/purge
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. First cacheable request - expected X-Cache: MISS
GET {{gateway}}/api/products

### 3. Repeat before TTL expiry - expected X-Cache: HIT
GET {{gateway}}/api/products

### 4. Private/no-store response - must not become a shared cache hit
GET {{gateway}}/api/private

### 5. Authorized request - local profile disables caching for these requests
GET {{gateway}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer example-user-token

### 6. Read the effective per-Route cache configuration
GET {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/routes/{{route}}/cache
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
